# 42. EMPATHY / RECIPROCITY
Empathy constructs a candidate model of another perspective.
It does not prove direct access to their internal state.
Bridge:
EXPRESSION
→ RECONSTRUCTION
→ RETURN SIGNAL
→ CORRECTION
Empathy proposes the bridge.
Reciprocity verifies traffic.
