# 43. DISCIPLINE / FUTURE LAZY
Handle:
DISCIPLINE = FUTURE LAZY
Mechanism:
selected_cost_now
→ reduced_future_friction
Discipline can be temporal self-cooperation.
Do work once when doing it reduces repeated future work.
