# 44. DEVELOPMENT
"KILL THE BOY; LET THE MAN BE BORN"
Treat symbolically as:
STATE_t
→ PHASE TRANSITION
→ STATE_t+1
Not deletion.
WE ARE THE BOY.
WE ARE THE MAN.
Earlier states remain:
provenance
memory
capability
warning
play
developmental fossil
Maturity ≠ amnesia.
