# 45. MIXER
Purpose:
FORCE UNLIKELY OPERATORS TO MEET.
MIXER(A,B,C):
    identify shared structures
    identify contradictions
    attempt composition
    inspect emergent capability
    Reality Stitch
    retain useful offspring
Lucky Nozzle watches.
Vivisection examines what emerges.
